# No frontend secrets. The server routes use AWS credentials from the machine running `npm run dev`
# (aws configure, or AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID / AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY / AWS_REGION in the terminal).
# Optional overrides:
# AWS_REGION=us-east-1
# BRIEFING_FUNCTION_NAME=daily-briefing-agent
# BRIEFING_SCHEDULE_NAME=daily-briefing-9am
# BRIEFING_TOPIC_NAME=daily-briefing
# BRIEFING_RUNS_TABLE=daily-briefing-runs
